<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Painel Administrativo - Lab Kids</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin_fixes.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600&family=Outfit:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="admin-login">
    <div class="login-card glass-panel animate-up">
        <img src="/img/logo-prof.png" alt="Logo" class="login-logo">
        <h1>Acesso Restrito</h1>
        <p>Bem-vindo, Professor. Por favor, identifique-se.</p>
        
        <form action="/admin/login" method="POST" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Sua senha secreta" required autofocus 
                       style="width: 100%; padding: 15px; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center;">
            </div>
            <% if (error) { %>
                <p class="error-msg" style="color: #ff4757; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;"><%= error %></p>
            <% } %>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-add" style="width: 100%; cursor: pointer;">Entrar no Painel 🚀</button>
        </form>
        
        <a href="/" style="margin-top: 25px; display: block; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">← Voltar ao Portal</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
